---
title: Batched & Clarified Tomatini
servings: 16
prep-time: 20 minutes
cook-time: 3 hours
tags: [mixology, cocktails, tomato cocktail, milk clarification]
source: https://www.instagram.com/reel/DNT60tWS8h-/
image: https://scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/532386580_18053032628449888_8417333768406579549_n.jpg?stp=cmp1_dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=sZWERtngjOAQ7kNvwGCUJ1S&_nc_oc=AdklQ3zUYd6vwe4ePzibbso4kh9Qu1ibuGGoKWA_Hx1hjDs7LJIgQiTz3oLCCJpMsiY&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=UdDo0FnS09MN-v-HzbAeUQ&oh=00_AflvHc9z9-LmCS3uL-z9lfxFlFA12GfDcDJV1tkGJurliA&oe=694C8BC3
---

Blend about @cherry tomatoes{3%cups} with a good pinch of @kosher salt{pinch} until you yield 16 oz of tomato juice after straining. Add that tomato juice to a #large bowl{} along with @lemon juice{2%oz}, @champagne vinegar{1%oz}, @simple syrup{1%oz}, @vermouth{10%oz}, @gin{35%oz}, @water{5%oz}, and @black pepper{6-8%cracks}.

To #large container{}, add @milk{12%oz}.

Slowly pour the tomatini into the milk in slow, circular motions.

Let it sit at room temperature for ~{3%hours}.

Strain the cocktail through a damp coffee filter.

To serve, pour it into a #chilled glass{} over a cherry tomato. Garnish with @olive oil{3%drops}.

Feel free to batch this and stick it in your freezer — that way it stays super cold and ready to pour.